{'symbol': 'KDP', 'date': '2022-04-20 23:09:00', 'title': 'KEURIG DR PEPPER ANNOUNCES EARLY TENDER RESULTS AND UPSIZING OF TENDER OFFERS FOR OUTSTANDING SERIES OF ITS SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES', 'text': "BURLINGTON, MASS. AND FRISCO, TEXAS , APRIL 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- \xa0AS PART OF THE COMPANY'S STRATEGIC REFINANCING ANNOUNCED ON APRIL 7, 2022, KEURIG DR PEPPER INC. (NASDAQ: KDP)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THE EARLY TENDER RESULTS FOR ITS SERIES OF TENDER OFFERS TO PURCHASE FOR CASH CERTAIN OF ITS OUTSTANDING SERIES OF SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES."}